\n🎮Added a \"play again\" feature.\n❤️Optimized interaction for fear value, pets, and prop systems.\n🔧Fixed several known bugs.\n\nCan you survive if a ghost is crazily trying to break into your house at midnight?\nIt's important to choose a room with essential equipment before the ghost shows up to help you survive, such as lavender, a safe, and a toolbox.\nRemember, the key to winning is to upgrade your door as soon as possible or to kill the ghost before it becomes strong enough to demolish your door.\nUpgrade door and artillery needs sufficient resources, whice requires a strategy to obtain and then balance them.\n\nIf you find the game difficult to play, you can try learning from other players.\n\nIf you enjoy this game, please give us a like👍\n🔔Favorite our game to get more updates!🔔","path":"/game/15217653337-ghost-at-the-door","slug":"15217653337-ghost-at-the-door","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0287b3cd5be86e0261fec1f320ff894afabe1f4c729764e3795de036865d12bc.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-afdad5dad07a584087382fb26cf5b02c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":4,"visitor":83525460,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-02-17T15:32:34.693Z","creator":{"name":"Narcissuss","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":17336513489,"name":"🎲Character RNG","desc":"A unique RNG game revolving around rolling iconic characters (that you can wear) 🎲 \n\n🍀Premium players get a permanent +20 Luck Boost, and a 10% faster roll speed! \n🏆Like the game, join the group, and turn on notifications for a +10 Luck Boost! \n(🍀Boosts stack with everything else!) \n\n📜There are currently 127 characters to roll in the game!\n⚙️ If your game is lagging, disable the auras in the settings!\n\nIf you encounter any bugs, please let us know on the group wall or server🐛 \n⚠️The game is currently in BETA. Chances, roll values, and character titles are still up to change.⚠️\n\nInspired by Sol's RNG\nCurrent Version: 7.05 (You can check your version in the settings menu)","path":"/game/17336513489-character-rng","slug":"17336513489-character-rng","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c3f5a4b13df8ecb6f72cdbd2c1a39560799bdcbe0316927cae567a2ca7102753.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-abbddfe63018d05180b988424f504982/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":4,"visitor":57356786,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-08-16T06:49:40.787Z","creator":{"name":"Pixel Forge Entertainment","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":10675066724,"name":"Slime Tower Tycoon [NEW!]","desc":"Welcome to Slime Tower Tycoon! In this game, you'll build an awesome tower full of different slimes & sell their droplets to earn coins! There's no limit to how many slimes you can earn!\r\n\r\n🏰 Build an infinite tower full of cute slimes! (Auto-merges at 175 individual slimes to avoid lag)\r\n\r\n💸 Buy new slimes & upgrade your cauldron to climb the leaderboard!\r\n\r\n✨ Merge slimes into rarer versions that give you extra droplets!\r\n\r\nScripting, Slime Models, UI: Sir_Falstaff\r\nEnvironment Design: TipToesTim\r\n\r\nCreated by one of the developers of OOF Tycoon! ","path":"/game/10675066724-slime-tower-tycoon","slug":"10675066724-slime-tower-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3624a92a2f70aeebd1d139b90cb10487a8d1ab7f0492865472f024d357e213d6.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b25db10c5d2881cead221912a15187a4/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":4,"visitor":36290114,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-04-16T15:01:07.681Z","creator":{"name":"Babble Games - Merge Tycoons","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":2}}],"totalGames":14204,"totalPages":592,"currentPage":309}